                        "form": "месси́ях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8fa3bc49-128b-327d-863c-bf3730167ff9",
                        "entry_id": "65d7a08a-ca8a-3f71-bc18-aff5ae5cb8a3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "религ. ожидаемый избавитель еврейского народа"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "в иудейской религии"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5dd5714c-ce49-4dde-8abd-fe3cd9227ac0",
                                "sense_id": "8fa3bc49-128b-327d-863c-bf3730167ff9",
                                "text": "Согласно верованиям иудеев, изначально все деревья были плодоносящими и все они будут плодоносящими, когда придет мессия."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "16b25c80-5853-34cb-ba5d-6d92671b64c9",
                        "entry_id": "65d7a08a-ca8a-3f71-bc18-aff5ae5cb8a3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., книжн. о том, в ком видят спасителя, избавителя"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd1ae3dc-a55c-413f-9d14-eb7613adc65e",
                                "sense_id": "16b25c80-5853-34cb-ba5d-6d92671b64c9",
                                "text": "Завершаются такие повествования, в зависимости от политических воззрений автора, либо выводом, что реформаторы в России потерпели жестокое поражение, либо ― в последнее время особенно часто ― что Россия после ряда лет блужданий в потемках все же выбирается на столбовую дорогу цивизизации, благо новый мессия у нее уже есть."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "83b0b193-0007-4265-a4f6-a363c2e51818",
                        "source_entry_id": "65d7a08a-ca8a-3f71-bc18-aff5ae5cb8a3",
                        "target_lang_word": "messiah",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "messiah",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23609d07-d8c1-39e8-863d-05c8ca6c2de9",
                                        "entry_id": "44278e63-4536-3f86-9d69-fb36e4d8225f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The one who is ordained by God to lead the people of Israel, believed by Christians and Muslims to be Jesus Christ."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50912b70-8667-3a1d-9511-798d6ba021f8",
                                        "entry_id": "44278e63-4536-3f86-9d69-fb36e4d8225f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A similar religious figure or awaited divine ruler, such as the Islamic Mahdi."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45e5a78d-691a-4376-b772-c18b343d9386",
                                                "sense_id": "50912b70-8667-3a1d-9511-798d6ba021f8",
                                                "text": "The spice exists on only one planet in the entire universe- a desolate, dry planet with vast deserts. Hidden away within the rocks of these deserts are a people known as the Fremen, who have long held a prophecy, that a man would come, a messiah, who would lead them to true freedom. The planet is Arrakis, also known as Dune."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "95baeff9-eb81-35de-8904-af3c2f7f8947",
                                        "entry_id": "44278e63-4536-3f86-9d69-fb36e4d8225f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An extremely powerful or revered figure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "568fbe06-7f63-4ba9-a16f-2a2d8accc16a",
                                                "sense_id": "95baeff9-eb81-35de-8904-af3c2f7f8947",
                                                "text": "At its best, psychoanalysis is the classic therapeutic technique for exploring unconscious processes. At its less-than-best, it is a jargon-opacified oedipus-complicated, libido-theoretical, pseudo-scientific cult whose messiah is Sigmund Freud."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1462f51-ab15-48d0-9881-da7e8b9d0dd7",
                                                "sense_id": "95baeff9-eb81-35de-8904-af3c2f7f8947",
                                                "text": "Girlie, as far as you're concerned, I'm the messiah of the DMV. Now, get out of the car."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c14546cd-3fe0-40ca-a327-53c048e1cfab",
